      "message": "As diagram in report, there are `open` and `requestStart` from client which will `getOutputForAttr` with same configuration and lead the `mDirectOpenCount` of mmap output in AudioPolicyManager be increased into 2. If we do error handle in `wrapUserThread`, the mmap output will keep `mDirectOpenCount` as 1 and not to close the output. Maybe there should be a guideline for client to handle this situation instead of doing error handle inside server side?",
